      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "+1 for this. I've been scrolling through the VRChat site looking for worlds to add to my Try Later favorites list and I occasionally click on worlds that I forgot I visited in the past. Also seeing the indicator on occasion would feel like a small achievement for people like me who love world hopping.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
